ox.co/storage/disk60/shows/51e8a091-afe3-4a56-9e8a-bc22f7b6d5ef.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/shows/315cec6d-2603-4fae-94d5-820a8e1d5ec7.jpg","likes":39,"dislikes":0,"views":5610,"release_date":"997401600000","length":11110,"description":"Three young men Akash, Sameer, and Siddharth are close friends, but their tastes and characters are completely incompatible. So when Siddharth falls in love with a much older woman, Tara, a woman who has been unsuccessful in keeping her marriage intact as well as alcohol-dependent, widens the rift between the trio, forcing them to part company. Years later, the trio will be re-united, they will be much mature and understanding, but will they still accept Siddharth love for Tara, especially when they themselves have fallen in love with women around their respective ages?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":1842,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}